. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x0bI80UvvGQQ7kNvwFvjIFa&_nc_oc=AdqNDs3qFJzY-ZQbQOtG4KZm-MwYECgDgFe4nRAcrKQb0N67Kzk1D8xbo_Ri6Y7mbyA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAJux7aO3l59Sj9ovutEcj0rro6XAjNVqpO07vtlmcrrQ&oe=6A5A27BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhtPi_zuvN4Q7kNvwFqS_VO&_nc_oc=AdpdjN1qSUOYqacvPZHTMDVF4pjCVIrojfDq7O8MOr6eM-a9E0MWU8tg_JQIrHX3MIk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD_0vY2_O7l6YgngbReHeINRxA_dUfa6Txohr80bmmv_g&oe=6A5A3E5E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=08wXuHMr9dsQ7kNvwFQ7R4r&_nc_oc=AdoKeW_x_lRj6zEvW2U-raaZqv0-7j1QqYYmL--jI-GOfBbtj4WFQC1R8_-6SxdjU64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCYSuJ1TVj_oDovhJuBzbEWvQBDZbbpObMPvgFjlWbIcw&oe=6A5A33DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco